<title>GERMANY: D. Telekom details income by U.S. GAAP.</title>
<headline>D. Telekom details income by U.S. GAAP.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Telekom AG details net income according to U.S. GAAP standards (in millions of marks unless noted):</p>
<p>					  1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net income			  2,574	  5,563</p>
<p> Results from ord. act.	  4,429	  9,493</p>
<p> Pretax profit		     4,429	  6,711</p>
<p> Income taxes		     (1,665)	  (991)</p>
<p> Income before extraord.,</p>
<p>   shareholder losses	    2,764	  5,720</p>
<p> Extraord. loss			(27)	  (159)</p>
<p> Losses of minority</p>
<p>   shareholders		     (163)	     2</p>
<p> Earnings per share in accordance with U.S. GAAP (in marks):</p>
<p>   Before extraord. losses	1.23	   2.82</p>
<p>   Extraordinary losses	  (0.01)	 (0.08)</p>
<p>   Net income per share	   1.22	   2.74</p>
<p> Weighted average shares (mln) 2,110	  2,030</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom, +49-228 26097150</p>
